window.products.push({"id":1156002,"name":"Mexican Margarita Glasses Turquoise White Swirl 15 oz set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VMeCWjayL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Every day is a fiesta whether serving margaritas or ice cream ( makes a great desert dish). These glasses are crafted in Mexico from recycled glass. Decorated with swrisl of turquoise and white bands of color they coordinate beautifully with the Colorful Turquoise and White Mexican Pitcher. Because they are handmade dimensions and colors may vary slightly. Sturdy enough for everyday use. Mouth-blown lead-free glass. Dishwasher Safe Size: approximately 6 1/2 inches high 4 1/2 inches wide; and holds around 15 oz. We also have matching shot glasses plus 6 other glasses in the turquoise and white design. See added sample photo. (glass not included with 4 margarita glasses) Care instructions: Our Mexican Glassware is individually mouth blown, hand formed and made from recycled glass. Trapped bubbles and slight variations in form, capacity and color are natural and charming features of the glassware. Although it is quite durable, this glass is not tempered so some extra care is necessary. A cooling-off period is essential after the glassware is removed from the dishwasher. Extreme temperature changes may cause thermal shock and cracking. This glassware is not suitable for serving hot beverages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VMeCWjayL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mexican Margarita Glasses","source_asin":"B081J633ZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081J633ZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081J633ZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
