window.products.push({"id":1156022,"name":"STONE DRUM  Window Film 3D Non Adhesive Window Privacy Film No Glue Static Cling Window Glass Film Decorative Anti UV Window Sticker Heat Control Wind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bHWyCYtYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Stone Drum window films are perfect for you if you want to bring your house magical changes Tips: 1.This product is only suitable for clean and smooth glass surface, do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials 2.This product adopts electrostatic technology, no need for glues. Before applying, you only need to sprinkle enough water on the glass surface. If the pasting is not firm, it may be the reason of insufficient water. You can tear the product off and paste again after watering 3.While using, be sure to tear off the back film, otherwise it will not be firmly attached 4.Please note the distinction between front side and back side, be sure to attache the back side (smooth side) to the glass, otherwise it will not be pasted firmly and even fall off 5.This product can only show the colors perfectly when the light is going through or reflected, so normally the colors can not be seen before the installation INSTRUCTION FOR INSTALLATION 1.Measure the window 2.Cut the film 3.Clean window glass 4.Spray water on the glass surface 5.Remove the back covering film 6.Paste the the smooth side of film to glass 7.Squeeze out water and air bubbles between the film and glass","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bHWyCYtYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STONE DRUM","source_asin":"B07RHCSS98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RHCSS98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RHCSS98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1156023,"name":"BAMFOX Floating Shelves Wall Mounted Set of 3, Rustic Bamboo Wall Storage Shelves for Bedroom, Living Room, Bathroom, Kitchen, Office and More … (Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SVoIpPgkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Natural wooden】BAMFOX's natural wooden wall frame uses only high-quality wood, which is strong and light. The surface of the carbonized pine wood is painted, so that the texture and color of each wood board are different to meet your unique needs. May this wooden wall shelf add beauty to your simple wall. 【Triangle Bracket】Triangle is the most stable structure. BAMFOX's triangle bracket adopts a one-piece 90° right-angled triangle design and is made of high-quality steel, which is strong, stable, and load-bearing. The surface of the bracket is painted, round, smooth, and flawless. We insist on using the simplest design to achieve the greatest load-bearing capacity. 【Reasonable storage space】Dimensions:10.5*5.8*4.4in(S)，13*5.8*4.4in(M) ，16.9*5.8*4.4in(L). After an investigation and trial, we decided to use the above sizes to meet diverse needs. This set of 3 wall-mounted storage racks uses natural wood planks of different sizes to provide a unique storage method for various styles of home. 【Multi-function and multi-scene】 The spacious and simple wooden wall frame is perfect for various scenes. Installed in the living room, so that the wall next to the TV is no longer lonely, perfect for storing game discs and various DVDs. Installed in the bathroom, you can use the cup and toothbrush as soon as you raise your hand, or simply decorate with scented candles. 【Wall storage】The spacious wall shelf can make full use of the wall space and is a favorite for small apartments. Make good use of the wall and keep the balance between the wall storage and the placement of the cabinets to create a neat sense of space and create a comfortable atmosphere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SVoIpPgkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAMFOX","source_asin":"B097PZ2JB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097PZ2JB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097PZ2JB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
