window.products.push({"id":1156093,"name":"Asani Corner Shower Caddy in Black, Set of 2, Adhesive-Backed Bathroom Corner Shelf with 4 Hooks and 8 Stickers, Stainless Steel Rust-Resistant Bathro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yEXabf4zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH STORAGE MADE INCREDIBLY EASYFuss-Free InstallationAdding bathroom storage doesn’t have to mean damaged walls, hole-riddled tile, or annoying suctions cups that never stay in place. Meet our adhesive-backed corner shower caddy – storage without the headache. Designed to fit in right-angled corners, our bath caddy set attaches to walls thanks to adhesive-backed stickers. And we mean extra-strong adhesive that doesn’t come off unless you want it to. For beginner-friendly installation, we’ve included a total of 8 stickers. This means you’ll have 4 as extras just in case.Made to LastNot all shower caddies are created equal. While most tend to corrode after a few weeks, we’ve used rust-resistant SUS304 stainless steel to forge ours. So, you end up with a bathroom organizer that withstands all the humidity without forming unsightly rust spots. And this hanging organizer isn’t just for your bathroom. Get an extra set for adding storage space to your kitchen and another one for holding detergent and cleaning supplies in the laundry room.Here are more reasons to love this shower shelf:- No drilling or screws are involved.- Every set includes 2 pieces to give you ample storage.- Comes with 4 removable hooks to hang your essentials.- Designed with a timeless touch of black to suit any décor. - The wire fan design optimizes drainage to keep items dry.- The minimalist design complements space-starved rooms.- Resistant to scratching and fading to preserve the striking look.Get your corner bathroom caddy with the confidence of a lifetime warranty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yEXabf4zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asani","source_asin":"B09GKNQDQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GKNQDQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GKNQDQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
