window.products.push({"id":1156194,"name":"Stiio Heated Blankets Electric Throw - Soft Flannel Electric Blanket, Machine Washable, Fast Heating with Hand Controller 10 Heating Settings and Auto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aFbMI2ZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Always Safe & Energy-Saving: ETL certified heated blanket with smart timer has overheat protection function in case you forget to shut it down. Exclusive heating system heats up in minutes. When the heating level is higher than level 4 on an over 3-hour timer, it will automatically switch to level 4 after 3 hours and continue to work until time is out, ensuring a whole night of comfort in absolute safety and energy efficiency. Super Soft & Warm: Stiio electric blanket throw is made of double-side flannel, which is extra soft, breathable, and warm. Compactly and evenly wired, the blanket warms up your whole body in an instant, ideal for relieving joint pain, relaxing muscle, and fighting tiredness. Find your desired warmth to enjoy winter on 10 heating levels(86℉-122℉). Wide Usage: Stiio heated throw blanket is completed with an easy-to-use controller with LCD display. The screen backlight will turn off within 10 seconds after the blanket is powered on, allowing you to sleep undisturbed. Two sizes Throw 50x60 inches and Full 72x84 inches is available for you. Remove the controller and turn it into a regular blanket with ultimate portability on the couch, on the sofa, in the car, in bed, on campsites, etc Machine Washable: Electric blanket comes with a detachable controller, and is machine washable & dryer safe. Remember to remove the controller before cleaning. Durable material keeps up softness and warmth after washing even for years to come. Top-grade Service: Give the gift of a cozy warm winter to your parents and lover! Initial choice for Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, New year and Birthday! We offer lifetime service. If you have any question, please feel free to contact us. (Note: Read user guide for specific use and maintenance instruction)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aFbMI2ZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stiio","source_asin":"B09ZKYTQRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZKYTQRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZKYTQRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
