window.products.push({"id":1156321,"name":"7-Pack Reusable Colored Flower Glass Straws with 2 Cleaning Brushes, Durable Thick Glass Straws, 0.31\"x7.9\" Bent Straws, Perfect for Smoothies, Milksh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ki2K56JGL._AC_SL1406_.jpg","description":"【Nice Glass Flower Design】The beautifully handmade glass flowers are sintered to the glass straw at high temperature and will not fall off. Decorated with sweet little flowers to make everything better. 【Reusable Glass Straws】These straws are made of food grade borosilicate glass, lead and BPA free. 2mm thick glass has high strength, stiffness, hardness and good wear resistance. No residual smell after use. 【Perfect Match for Various Beverages】Perfect match for all kinds of tumblers, mason jars, bar glasses and many more glasses. Suitable for Various beverages, smoothies, shakes, water, coffee, tea, milk and cocktails. 【Easy to Clean】With the included 7.9-inch brush that goes through the entire straw, cleaning becomes super easy. They are also dishwasher safe. 【Package Included】7 bent glass straws with different colored glass flowers, 2 straw brushes. Straw Size: 0.3\"x7.9\" Brush Size: 7.9\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ki2K56JGL._AC_SL1406_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COCGVEL","source_asin":"B0BLRVT93H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLRVT93H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLRVT93H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1156322,"name":"FGSDSE Meat Thermometer for Cooking, Digital Cooking Thermometer with Calibration, Instant Read 5S for Kitchen BBQ Baking Candy Liquids Oil Oven Smoke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HdTdJfFrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Meat Thermometer with Smart Design】Digital meat thermometer will auto-shut off to save battery life if readout stays for 10 minutes. Stainless foldable tapered probe-length 11cm, simply pull out the probe, insert into your food or liquid and read the temperature. Hold butten-Before withdrawing probe, push \"HOLD\". The meat thermometer will hold the temperature reading until pressed again. 【Ultra Fast and Accurate】Takes the temperature in a little as 5 seconds, and is accurate to +/-1 degrees with a wide range of -58℉-572℉（-50°C~300°C）. No more waiting over a hot stove or grill for the temperature to settle! Take out the guesswork and eliminate overdone or undercooked food, and instead make perfectly cooked beef, chicken, pork, fish, lamb, or turkey, every time! 【Easy to Use and Store】Food thermometer with auto-on/off function, open the probe to turn on, fold the probe to turn off. Stick probe into meat or food and wait for the internal temperature displayed on the LCD screen. Magnetic back and hook allows for convenient storage. It can be affixed to the fridge, and can also be placed in the drawer or hangs on the hook. You can conveniently store this where you can have easy and quick access! 【Reliable and Secure】The meat thermometers body made of strong ABS environment-friendly plastic and the long probe is made of food-grade stainless steel. 4.5 inch super long 180° fold-able rotation probe to detect the core temperature of meat. No more hands' burning. You can also calibrate the kitchen thermometer and know the Max and Min temperature when cooking. 【Best Value Digital Food Thermometer】Makes a great a gift idea for any cooking or barbecue enthusiast. Now Share the cooking thermometer with your family and friends, do not miss the good times this thermometer can bring you! Makes a great a gift idea for any cooking or barbecue enthusiast! Powered by AAA battery (included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HdTdJfFrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FGSDSE","source_asin":"B09DSHD4V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DSHD4V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DSHD4V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
