window.products.push({"id":1156494,"name":"Tipcoo Corner Shower Caddy, 5 Pack Rustproof Shower Organizer,Durable Shower Shelves, No Drilling Stainless Steel Shower Storage Rack with Soap Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EFF+25DgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Shower Organizer Set-Are you tired of the messy bathroom?Our bathroom shower shelves set include 2 shower caddies、2 soap holders、1 toothbrush holder and 14 adhesives(extra stickies came with it in case if you mess up the first try ).Large storage capacity bathroom organizer shower can store all of your bath supplies(shampoo,conditioner,body wash and other items).These organizers can well meet your diverse daily needs!No longer worry about spreading annoying confusion,keeps your shower organized. Strong Adhesion - “L” Shape of the shower caddy is designed for making full use of corner space. make corner shower caddy hold more and can better accommodate heavy containers. The shower storage secures firmly via durable, traceless adhesive that won’t damage the shower wall. Grip tighty to smooth surfaces. Adhesives shower caddy provide super stability. It has been tested, shower shelves can hold up to 40 lbs, enough to hold all shower stuffs. No worry about any loss caused by falling Durable Shower Shelf - Black shower caddy made of high-quality 304 stainless steel, waterproof, rust-proof, scratch-resistant.The corner shower caddy comes in an open-grid design for maximum air ventilation and water dripping away. And resists to scratches and corrosion. Not only keeping your shower items clean and tidy.but also grid can prevent some small objects from falling. Shower shelf edge for the bottom wires provide more support as well. Make it stronger, safer, longer life cycle. Drill-Free Installation-Bathroom storage shower caddy can be installed easily within minutes.No tools or drilling is required.First,ensure that area is cleaned and dry before installing.2,draw a line with an erasable marker to mark the position where the adhesive will be placed.3,stick the adhesive hooks to wall.Finally,waiting the 24 hours,place shelves on the adhesive hooks.Adhesive tapes are removable.Just heat the surfaces with a hair dryer for 5 mins and peel them off.No damage to the wall. Multiple Applications- Theses stainless steel shower caddies are suitable for ceramic tile,marble, tempered glass,smooth solid wood wall,smooth solid metal and other smooth walls.They could be installed in bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room,dormitory, washbasin and other places. If you tired of the messy bathroom, Large-capacity storage shower caddy will make your bathroom more clean and tidy.Create your tidy space.If you have any questions,please contact us,we will reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EFF+25DgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tipcoo","source_asin":"B0BWR64K5P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWR64K5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWR64K5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
