window.products.push({"id":1156516,"name":"yaocoral Wall Mounted Toothbrush Holder Adhesive Shower Caddy Bathroom Shower Organizer Wall Shelf Shampoo Spice Holder for Shower Room Bathroom Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DLmvxOxIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.💖【Trustworthy Material】 - Adhesive shower caddy Made from High Impact ABS that are waterproof durable and can withstand 5 Lb,not easy to fall off.White plastic bath shower shelf,smooth rounded corners,withstand 5 Lbs,not easy to fall off.Package including:1 shower caddy and 1 adhesive sticker . 💖【Quick dry & Drain Design】Drainage holes at the bottom of the waterproof adhesive wall shelf allow water to run away,without water accumulation,keeping your bathroom toiletries completely dry. 💖【Easy to Install】--No drills or holes are needed. Transparent adhesive leaves no damage to wall, please clean up the back side and the surface of the wall before use, tear off the protective film of the bracket and stick it directly on a smooth surface, If you want to use it in another location, you can tear it off and reuse it.The wall storage holder can be removed at any time for cleaning and hanging again. 💖【 MULTI FUNCTIONAL】Wall mounted Bathroom Shower shelf Organizer, powerful and easy to install.Dimension:7.87\" Lx 3.74\" Wx 4.13\" H, Help save space on counter, You can use this wall storage holder not only for bathroom storage: such as soaps, spice,shampoos, toothbrushes,conditioner, body wash, bubble bath holder and more within easy reach,but also storage small items for kitchen,study room,living room,such as:remote, cookware,silverware and cutlery,pen,Stationery holder. 💖【APPLY FOR MORE SURFACE】 This adhesive bathroom shower organizer fits for smooth & flat surface like ceramic tile, glass, mirror, granite, stainless steel, acrylic, laminate and any non-porous surface with glossy finish, can not be used for any porous or rough surface. When installing this Adhesive wall organizer, please try hard to make sure there is no air between the sticker and the surface, Do not install between the gaps of the ceramic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DLmvxOxIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yaocoral","source_asin":"B0BNW3DCX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNW3DCX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNW3DCX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
