window.products.push({"id":1156576,"name":"Qmagic Heavy Duty Suction Cup Hooks - Suitable for Rough Surfaces - Removable - Cup Diameter 72mm (White, 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zvf7pAl7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUITABLE FOR ROUGH SURFACES!:Made of high-quality ABS plastic, stainless steel spring and high-density rubber ring for suction cup that can work on non-porous (airproof), smooth Surfaces and Semi-Smooth surfaces (<0.5mm in thickness), Such as painted wood, grained wood doors, textured tiles, frosted glass, mirror, PVC board, Acrylic board, antique bricks metal etc. DAMAGE FREE INSTALLATION AND SUPER SUCTION: No nail, no drilling Installation, only press the button. All suction cups pass SGS test to Hold up Min load of 12 pounds at the beginning and Max of 20 Pounds under the constant force of the spring after 72 hours. REMOVABLE, ADJUSTABLE AND REUSABLE: Easily removable reusable press and hold the button, and take it off If needed in future to different position. WATERPROOF, OILPROOF AND LONG LASTING: Multipurpose Suction Cup Hooks can hang almost anything: towels, toys, bath robes, squeegees, kitchen tools etc. Suitable for any circumstance and stay suctioned for years only need to keep checking the yellow indicator ring regularly. 100% RISK-FREE SATISFACTION : We're offering the premium quality and the best service. If you product doesn’t work as expected please let up know and we will help solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zvf7pAl7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qmagic","source_asin":"B07K75RWND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K75RWND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K75RWND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1156577,"name":"KitchenAid Gourmet Essentials 12-Piece Nonstick Hard Base Cookware Set, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EY13SHSAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This cookware set is an exceptional value, including all of the pans needed to equip your kitchen with the most used cooking pieces. As the set contains only basic pieces, you'll really use each and every pan. Not recommended for use on ceramic/glass stovetops. Amazon.com Why not choose cookware that brightens up your kitchen décor? KitchenAid's Gourmet Essentials Hard-Base cookware features not only a heavy-gauge aluminum core for fast, even heating, but porcelain enamel exteriors in a choice of bright red and other colors. The three-layer nonstick finish inside each piece is primed with the company's patented hard base ceramic primer for toughness, resulting in long-lasting durability and quick food release. KitchenAid further embellishes these colorful pots with dual-riveted, stainless-steel handles that are wrapped with comfortable, stay-cool silicone grips. The lids, made of 18/10 stainless steel, also feature silicone-wrapped handles, highly arched to enable easy grasping with a potholder or oven mitt. Both the pans and lids are oven-safe up to 350 degrees F. Take note: the cookware is not dishwasher-safe, and should not be used on ceramic or glass cooktops. An excellent value, this 12-piece set consists of the most frequently used kitchen pots and pans and makes a great gift set. The two skillets, measuring 8 and 10 inches in diameter, handle everyday frying and sautéing needs, from eggs-over-easy to grilled cheese sandwiches to fish filets, then crepes for dessert. Three saucepans holding 1, 2, and 3 quarts let you boil a couple eggs, heat soup, and slow-cook rice. The large 8-quart stockpot with two loop handles works admirably for family-sized batches of pasta, chili, soup, and corn-on-the-cob. Finally, the 12-inch/5-quart covered sauté is so versatile you'll use it often to fry chicken, braise meats, and whip up vegetable stir-fries. The nonstick finish releases food quickly and makes clean up by hand a snap. KitchenAid covers the set with a limited lifetime warranty. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 12-piece cookware set. The set consists of: 1-quart covered saucepan; 2-quart covered saucepan; 3-quart covered saucepan; 8-quart covered stockpot; 8-inch skillet; 10-inch skillet; 12-inch/5-quart covered sauté pan. 12 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EY13SHSAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B0009U5MZO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009U5MZO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009U5MZO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
