window.products.push({"id":1156721,"name":"CICN Stainless Steel Soap, Metal Deodorant Soap that Eliminates Odors-garlic and Fishy Odors and Excess Odors on Hands and Skin (Triangle + With Box)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519eDSFHQAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Stainless steel soap principle: The deodorizing principle of stainless steel soap is basically decomposed. When the stainless steel alloy comes into contact with air and water molecules at the same time, it will produce a catalyst effect, which will break down the molecular structure of odors and \"restore\" them into an odorless state. The stainless steel material is rubbed against the object by a specially polished matte surface, and the released iron ions are combined with odor molecules to achieve the effect of removing odor. Stainless steel soaps are usually \"half thrown into water and half exposed to air.\" When using for the first time, it takes 5-6 hours to wait for normal work. Effective use time can be maintained for 3 to 5 years. how to use: 1. Pack a wet towel (or immerse the steel soap half in a water bowl) can also be used as a refrigerator deodorizer, and it can also be placed in the kitchen or bathroom to deodorize; 2. Wipe the tableware with a block wet towel or soak it with the tableware for a while, and rinse with running water to remove the odor of the tableware; 3. Can adsorb and decompose toxic gas molecules such as formaldehyde in the decorated room. Soak half of the stainless steel soap in a water bowl and place in the decorated room. 4. You can remove the odor of the pet's nest, soak half of the stainless steel soap in a water bowl and place it near the pet's nest; 5. Can remove underarm odor, scrub with a wet towel when bathing; 6. Can deodorize the feet, and wipe the stinky feet with a wet towel when washing the feet; 7. It can remove most of the odors such as medicine smell, disinfection water smell, banknote smell, gasoline smell, diesel smell and so on. Please refer to the usage method and use it with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519eDSFHQAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CICN","source_asin":"B082SPBGLY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082SPBGLY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082SPBGLY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
