window.products.push({"id":1156762,"name":"CXLiy Neck Fan, Neck Air Conditioner, 3 Cooling Plates Portable Neck Fan, Hands-Free Around the Personal Fan, Semiconductor Cooling Neck Fan 2 Modes (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714zLPM8p3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【Instant Cooling】This portable mini neck air conditioner uses semiconductor cooling technology. The current generated by the semiconductor cooling chip creates a temperature difference and achieves instant cooling. The key to cooling down in summer is instantly cool down your body surface temperature, the neck air conditioner’s instant refrigeration technology of neck fan makes it possible. 🧊【3 Cooling Modules & 2 mode】Bladeless neck fan is equipped with three aluminum blocks to reduce body temperature (only air conditioning cooling, no fan duct will not blow), and provides two modes (weak and strong) can be switched by clicking the power button, instant cooling 12-16 °, the two sides of the adjustable pull belt design (2cm), adjusted to the situation, more like tailor-made, so you can feel comfortable and cool in the summer. 🔋【Portable neck fan &with 10000mAH Power Bank】The neck fan does not have a built-in battery and needs to be connected to the power supply at all times when in use. The package is equipped with 10000mAH mobile power (1. Connect the neck fan and mobile power together through the connection cable, 2. Click the power button to open the neck air conditioner, connect the equipped 10000mAH mobile power, and the weak mode can be used continuously for 5 hours) to keep you cool at all times. 🔇【Low Noise】Bladeless neck fan worn around the neck uses a bladeless design to bring a quiet and cool breeze. This fan has a lot of power, but it weighs only 225grams and is not difficult to carry. Even if you wear it for a day, you won't feel exhausted. Most neck fans on the market are of the three-blade design, which makes them less air volume and louder. ☺【Stylish Hands-Free Design And Hassle-Free After-Sales】Personal Fans' appearance is the headphone design, fashionable and versatile. When using without worrying about hair getting rolled in, also free your hands. The company provides lifetime technical support and after-sales service, please get in touch with us when you have any questions about the product. 🚨 The product uses semiconductor trilateral cooling, only the neck air conditioning cooling, no 3D airflow, no fan duct will not be out of the air!!! ☺【Please Note! 】Portable neck fan without built-in battery, we with a 10000mah mobile power for your use, in the use of the neck fan, need to always connect the power (mobile power) when the neck fan is not in use, the mobile power can also be used for your cell phone, headphones, charging. ☺ Neck air conditioner (will not be out of the air) can not be charged, there is no built-in battery, you can use a different USB battery to update (10000mAH mobile power in the box, when using the device must be connected to the USB battery, disconnection will stop working) so you can turn off the battery without charging the device, because if you add a battery, then the battery will be small, in order to reduce the weight of the product, we use this technology.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714zLPM8p3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CXLiy","source_asin":"B09XB2LS4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XB2LS4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XB2LS4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
