window.products.push({"id":1156930,"name":"Pairs Well with Planning a Wedding Wine Label, Set of 2 Bottle Stickers, Personalized Engagement Gift, Custom Wedding Party Decorations, Funny Unique ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q7DdyjtyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Try Before You Buy Utilize the handy dandy built-in design tool to craft your one-of-a-kind creation! Preview your awesome work before purchasing to make sure it's the perfect product of your imaginative talent 💃 Instantly step up your party planning game! Gone are the days of centerpieces made with floating candles and flower pedals. A personalized bottle makes for great décor and an even better conversation piece. Whether you leave it as is or jazz it up with ribbon or some confetti, your unique decoration is sure to impress! It's a gift! It’s a decoration! It’s a gift and a decoration! The answer is all of the above! Your custom bottle is a thoughtful keepsake your loved one is sure to cherish. Make it extra sappy to increase the chance of happy tears. Not so much for sentimentality? Slap on a funny quote to get the crowd roaring. Get creative with your text to make a memory that will last a lifetime. Great for any occasion! Birthdays, weddings, showers, holidays, you name it! In fact, I can’t think of an occasion a personalized bottle of wine wouldn’t make better! Maybe an A.A. meeting… I would not recommend bringing wine there. Easy Peasy Choose a standard 750ml bottle with a straight body to ensure your label applies smoothly. Although the 3.75” x 4.75” label can be applied over the existing label, it is recommended to remove the original label before applying your new and improved, much cooler label. Detailed instructions are included and there are many tips and tricks online. I’m also just one message away if you have any questions at all. Not quite your style? Take a Scroll Design has a variety of unique designs that are sure to fit your needs. Visit the Take a Scroll Design, LLC storefront or send me a message with what you have in mind!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q7DdyjtyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Take a Scroll Design","source_asin":"B09TPY31PB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1156930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TPY31PB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TPY31PB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
